	"locales": {
		"hu": {
			"subject": "Üdvözlünk a(z) {{organizationName}} csapatában!",
			"html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n\t<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\t<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\t<title>Üdvözlünk - {{organizationName}}</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f5;\">\n\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f4f4f5;\">\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 48px 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width: 520px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 32px 32px 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #3b82f6;\">{{appNameHtml}}</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 0 32px 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1 style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: #18181b; text-align: center;\">Üdvözlünk, {{name}}!</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #52525b;\">A(z) <strong>{{appName}}</strong> rendszeren belül a(z) <strong>{{organizationName}}</strong> szervezethez regisztráltak dolgozóként a(z) <strong>{{pluginName}}</strong> alkalmazásban. A fiókod elkészült, így bármikor be tudsz jelentkezni a saját jelszavaddal.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #52525b;\">Az első bejelentkezéshez be kell állítanod egy jelszót. Kattints a lenti gombra és add meg az email címedet — küldünk egy linket, amivel egyedi jelszót tudsz választani.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 8px 0 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"{{appUrl}}/admin/forget-password\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #3b82f6; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 14px;\">Jelszó beállítása</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f9fafb; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 16px 20px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #52525b; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;\">Belépési adatok</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 14px; color: #18181b;\"><strong>Email:</strong> {{email}}</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t{{positionHtml}}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t{{departmentHtml}}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #71717a;\">Ha kérdésed van a fiókoddal kapcsolatban, fordulj a(z) {{organizationName}} adminisztrátorához.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 24px 32px; border-top: 1px solid #e4e4e7;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #a1a1aa; text-align: center;\">Ez az e-mail a {{email}} címre lett küldve, mert egy adminisztrátor regisztrált a(z) {{appName}} rendszerébe.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</table>\n</body>\n</html>",
			"text": "Üdvözlünk, {{name}}!\n\nA(z) {{appName}} rendszeren belül a(z) {{organizationName}} szervezethez regisztráltak dolgozóként a(z) {{pluginName}} alkalmazásban. A fiókod elkészült.\n\nAz első bejelentkezéshez be kell állítanod egy jelszót. Látogasd meg az alábbi oldalt és add meg az email címedet — küldünk egy linket, amivel egyedi jelszót tudsz választani:\n\n{{appUrl}}/admin/forget-password\n\nBelépési adatok:\n  Email: {{email}}\n{{positionText}}{{departmentText}}\nHa kérdésed van, fordulj a(z) {{organizationName}} adminisztrátorához.\n\nÜdvözlettel,\n{{appName}}"
		},
		"en": {
			"subject": "Welcome to the {{organizationName}} team!",
			"html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n\t<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\t<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\t<title>Welcome - {{organizationName}}</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f5;\">\n\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f4f4f5;\">\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 48px 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width: 520px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 32px 32px 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #3b82f6;\">{{appNameHtml}}</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 0 32px 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1 style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: #18181b; text-align: center;\">Welcome, {{name}}!</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #52525b;\">You have been registered as an employee within the <strong>{{appName}}</strong> system, in the <strong>{{organizationName}}</strong> organization, via the <strong>{{pluginName}}</strong> application. Your account is ready, so you can sign in any time using your own password.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #52525b;\">For your first sign-in you need to set a password. Click the button below and enter your email address — we'll send you a link to choose your own password.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 8px 0 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"{{appUrl}}/admin/forget-password\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #3b82f6; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 14px;\">Set your password</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f9fafb; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 16px 20px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #52525b; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;\">Sign-in details</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 14px; color: #18181b;\"><strong>Email:</strong> {{email}}</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t{{positionHtml}}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t{{departmentHtml}}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #71717a;\">If you have any questions about your account, please contact the {{organizationName}} administrator.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 24px 32px; border-top: 1px solid #e4e4e7;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #a1a1aa; text-align: center;\">This email was sent to {{email}} because an administrator registered you in the {{appName}} system.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</table>\n</body>\n</html>",
			"text": "Welcome, {{name}}!\n\nYou have been registered as an employee within the {{appName}} system, in the {{organizationName}} organization, via the {{pluginName}} application. Your account is ready.\n\nFor your first sign-in you need to set a password. Visit the page below and enter your email address — we'll send you a link to choose your own password:\n\n{{appUrl}}/admin/forget-password\n\nSign-in details:\n  Email: {{email}}\n{{positionText}}{{departmentText}}\nIf you have any questions, please contact the {{organizationName}} administrator.\n\nBest regards,\n{{appName}}"
		}
	}
}
